    "text": "```python\ndef rolling_pair_sums(values):\n    \"\"\"Return each adjacent pair's sum; return [] when fewer than two values exist.\"\"\"\n    it = iter(values)\n    try:\n        prev = next(it)\n    except StopIteration:\n        return []\n    result = []\n    for curr in it:\n        result.append(prev + curr)\n        prev = curr\n    return result\n```",
